after" viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><path id="proof-arc-after-clarify" d="M 40 74 A 34 34 0 0 0 74 40" fill="none"></path><text><textPath href="#proof-arc-after-clarify" startOffset="50%" text-anchor="middle">After</textPath></text></svg><header><span>New project</span><small>Step 1 of 3</small></header><p class="proof-h">What should this project improve?</p><p>Choose one focus. You can add more context next.</p><div class="proof-clarify-options"><span>Activation</span><span>Retention</span><span>Conversion</span></div><span class="proof-clarify-cta">Use this focus →</span></article></div></div><div class="hero-proof-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="hero-proof-drag" aria-hidden="true"></div><input class="hero-proof-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="71" aria-label="Reveal the improved /clarify example" data-proof-range></div></div><div class="hero-proof-tabs ks-instrument-strip is-paper" data-cable-to data-impeccable-ignore="cramped-padding" role="tablist" aria-label="Preview Impeccable commands"><button type="button" role="tab" class="hero-proof-tab ks-instrument-key is-active" id="hero-proof-tab-polish" aria-controls="hero-proof-panel-polish" aria-label="/polish Remove the tells" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-proof-tab="polish">/polish</button><button type="button" role="tab" class="hero-proof-tab ks-instrument-key" id="hero-proof-tab-distill" aria-controls="hero-proof-panel-distill" aria-label="/distill Find the hierarchy" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-proof-tab="distill">/distill</button><button type="button" role="tab" class="hero-proof-tab ks-instrument-key" id="hero-proof-tab-clarify" aria-controls="hero-proof-panel-clarify" aria-label="/clarify Make the task obvious" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-proof-tab="clarify">/clarify</button></div></section></div></div></section><div class="site-content"><!-- 01b. TESTIMONIALS: five-variant section, switcher in the bottom-right
         floating panel. Sits between the hero and the slop teaser. The dot-grid
         divider that used to open the slop section now opens this one. --><section class="testimonials-section" id="testimonials" aria-label="What people say about Impeccable" data-testimonials data-motion="static" data-impeccable-ignore="marquee"><div class="t-marquee"><div class="t-marquee-row" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Testimonials: scroll to read more"><div class="t-marquee-track"><div class="t-marquee-set"><div class="t-card t-card--plinth"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">It fucking works beautifully. It&#39;s so cool.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><span class="t-coin" aria-hidden="true">D</span><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Ben Davis</cite><span class="t-handle">@davis7</span></span></footer></div><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/MertcanDYuzer/status/2047058254878945560" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable &gt; Claude design</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/MertcanDYuzer.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Mertcan Yüzer</cite><span class="t-handle">@MertcanDYuzer</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/adrien_ninet/status/2041825321721458961" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Uninstall whatever frontend skill you&#39;re using. Replace it with Impeccable.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/adrien_ninet.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Adrien Ninet</cite><span class="t-handle">@adrien_ninet</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/illscience/status/2046953520449114555" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is the most slept on tool for incorporating design thinking into coding workflows.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/illscience.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Anish Acharya</cite><span class="t-handle">@illscience</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/cathrynlavery/status/2055485368632295911" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">When anyone asks me about design for frontend I always recommend @impeccable_ai plugin. I&#39;m very picky with design and it&#39;s become part of my everyday stack.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/cathrynlavery-1.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Cathryn Lavery</cite><span class="t-handle">@cathrynlavery</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/IanAndrewsDC/status/2029553242712002879" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">This is probably what Figma Make should be.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/IanAndrewsDC.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Ian Andrews</cite><span class="t-handle">@IanAndrewsDC</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/carlrannaberg/status/2053016778855305304" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is hands down the best UI design skill out there. I use it daily and recommend it to others as well. Great work! 💪</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/carlrannaberg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Carl Rannaberg</cite><span class="t-handle">@carlrannaberg</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/BowTiedGroundHo/status/2055062377541091373" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">It has taken my ability to ship complex and beautiful designs to another level.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/BowTiedGroundHo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">BowTiedGroundHog</cite><span class="t-handle">@BowTiedGroundHo</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/ivanleomk/status/2041371674248147047" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is the best skill I&#39;ve used this year. Can&#39;t believe it&#39;s free.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/ivanleomk.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Ivan Leo</cite><span class="t-handle">@ivanleomk</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/wanikwai/status/2044973876963311928" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is so so good. I love it.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/wanikwai.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Watson Cyrus Anikwai</cite><span class="t-handle">@wanikwai</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/faizan10114/status/2052872900324057321" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">I will fight anyone who say anything bad against impeccable, just let me know who they are.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/faizan10114.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Faizan Khan</cite><span class="t-handle">@faizan10114</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/Hicker_Moledao/status/2057451530459160942" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">I&#39;ve tried and used many UI design tools that enhance AI aesthetics, and this one is the best and most stunning I&#39;ve ever used.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/Hicker_Moledao.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Hickerzed</cite><span class="t-handle">@Hicker_Moledao</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/largePrawn/status/2054644203330961471" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Jorks ur shit crazy style</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/largePrawn.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Tony Ge</cite><span class="t-handle">@largePrawn</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/karatzas_thomas/status/2052753026864042368" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">@impeccable_ai is really good and is the first time I really felt a 10x productivity boost with AI. And I make an effort to try as many tools as possible.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/karatzas_thomas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Thomas Karatzas</cite><span class="t-handle">@karatzas_thomas</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/faizan10114/status/2052620908615917922" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">TIL you are the guy behind Impeccable. I owe like 3 customer conversions to you. Thank you for such an amazing tool.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/faizan10114.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Faizan Khan</cite><span class="t-handle">@faizan10114</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/MikitaHQ/status/2043352324047774008" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Shipped a landing page in 2 hours using @conductor_build &amp; @impeccable_ai. From idea to prod faster than most people pick a font ;))</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/MikitaHQ.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Mikita</cite><span class="t-handle">@MikitaHQ</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/vandotorres/status/2042263432448090256" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">THIS. This shit works.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/vandotorres.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Servando</cite><span class="t-handle">@vandotorres</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/eclecticV/status/2042086081827623331" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">This is the best plugin ever created imo.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/eclecticV.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Vishveshwar Jatain</cite><span class="t-handle">@eclecticV</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/nik_ska/status/2037158216488919184" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Claude skills are mostly BS. These ones are the rare, truly useful ones.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/nik_ska.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Nik</cite><span class="t-handle">@nik_ska</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/HeyZohaib/status/2047568264273023058" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">How is this free?? 🔥🔥</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/HeyZohaib.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Zohaib A.</cite><span class="t-handle">@HeyZohaib</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/IceCreamChai/status/2056718266593341867" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">It&#39;s crazy that @impeccable_ai is free. It replaces some paid products while being better than them.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/IceCreamChai.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Sankalp Mukim</cite><span class="t-handle">@IceCreamChai</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/michaelhedgpeth/status/2045283339264028817" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">@impeccable_ai has been a huge help at all levels from prototyping to production. It has really upped our game. I can&#39;t see anything out-of-the-box like this replacing it.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/michaelhedgpeth.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Michael Hedgpeth</cite><span class="t-handle">@michaelhedgpeth</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/littlemartta/status/2039038639087194470" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is the best frontend design skill I&#39;ve used rn. It clears the alternatives by a mile.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/littlemartta.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">martta_xu</cite><span class="t-handle">@littlemartta</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/Paul_Kinlan/status/2047580124141310457" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">This is incredible. Developer and Designer workflows are changing so quickly and for the better.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/Paul_Kinlan.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Paul Kinlan</cite><span class="t-handle">@Paul_Kinlan</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/JASHANGUPTA15/status/2057568922443133188" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Recently used this skill for my personal portfolio and was blown away. Iterated multiple times on Claude code and hardly touched Figma.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/JASHANGUPTA15.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Jashan Gupta</cite><span class="t-handle">@JASHANGUPTA15</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/sid_hori/status/2030486593048326567" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">This is 🔥. My landing page looked 100% vibe coded. I think it looks very decent now. I had fun in the process.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/sid_hori.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Sidney Hori Hawthorne</cite><span class="t-handle">@sid_hori</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/billzh/status/2035525691085603172" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">I&#39;m glad that we never need to touch Figma again. Just run 8 agents using @paper w/ Impeccable&#39;s Claude skills.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/billzh.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">billzh</cite><span class="t-handle">@billzh</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/johnennis/status/2038248854726791481" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is such a great skill. I use it multiple times a day every day and it makes a huge difference.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/johnennis.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">John Ennis</cite><span class="t-handle">@johnennis</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/devsome_sh/status/2049193038447264007" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Upgraded an internal tool with better UI, UX, branding and reduced AI slop. This established a standard for the project itself.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/devsome_sh.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Somesh</cite><span class="t-handle">@devsome_sh</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/alejandroreyes/status/2055495489777434973" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">It&#39;s so good.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/alejandroreyes.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Alejandro Reyes</cite><span class="t-handle">@alejandroreyes</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/EmreCoklar/status/2036873830191251677" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">This is the only set of agent skills I ever found use in. Thanks for making this.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/EmreCoklar.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Emre Coklar</cite><span class="t-handle">@EmreCoklar</span></span></footer></a></div><div class="t-marquee-set" aria-hidden="true" inert><div class="t-card t-card--plinth"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">It fucking works beautifully. It&#39;s so cool.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><span class="t-coin" aria-hidden="true">D</span><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Ben Davis</cite><span class="t-handle">@davis7</span></span></footer></div><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/MertcanDYuzer/status/2047058254878945560" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable &gt; Claude design</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/MertcanDYuzer.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Mertcan Yüzer</cite><span class="t-handle">@MertcanDYuzer</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/adrien_ninet/status/2041825321721458961" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Uninstall whatever frontend skill you&#39;re using. Replace it with Impeccable.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/adrien_ninet.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Adrien Ninet</cite><span class="t-handle">@adrien_ninet</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/illscience/status/2046953520449114555" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is the most slept on tool for incorporating design thinking into coding workflows.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/illscience.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Anish Acharya</cite><span class="t-handle">@illscience</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/cathrynlavery/status/2055485368632295911" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">When anyone asks me about design for frontend I always recommend @impeccable_ai plugin. I&#39;m very picky with design and it&#39;s become part of my everyday stack.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/cathrynlavery-1.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Cathryn Lavery</cite><span class="t-handle">@cathrynlavery</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/IanAndrewsDC/status/2029553242712002879" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">This is probably what Figma Make should be.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/IanAndrewsDC.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Ian Andrews</cite><span class="t-handle">@IanAndrewsDC</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/carlrannaberg/status/2053016778855305304" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is hands down the best UI design skill out there. I use it daily and recommend it to others as well. Great work! 💪</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/carlrannaberg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Carl Rannaberg</cite><span class="t-handle">@carlrannaberg</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/BowTiedGroundHo/status/2055062377541091373" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">It has taken my ability to ship complex and beautiful designs to another level.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/BowTiedGroundHo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">BowTiedGroundHog</cite><span class="t-handle">@BowTiedGroundHo</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/ivanleomk/status/2041371674248147047" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is the best skill I&#39;ve used this year. Can&#39;t believe it&#39;s free.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/ivanleomk.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Ivan Leo</cite><span class="t-handle">@ivanleomk</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/wanikwai/status/2044973876963311928" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is so so good. I love it.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/wanikwai.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Watson Cyrus Anikwai</cite><span class="t-handle">@wanikwai</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/faizan10114/status/2052872900324057321" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">I will fight anyone who say anything bad against impeccable, just let me know who they are.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/faizan10114.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Faizan Khan</cite><span class="t-handle">@faizan10114</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/Hicker_Moledao/status/2057451530459160942" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">I&#39;ve tried and used many UI design tools that enhance AI aesthetics, and this one is the best and most stunning I&#39;ve ever used.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/Hicker_Moledao.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Hickerzed</cite><span class="t-handle">@Hicker_Moledao</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/largePrawn/status/2054644203330961471" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Jorks ur shit crazy style</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/largePrawn.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Tony Ge</cite><span class="t-handle">@largePrawn</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/karatzas_thomas/status/2052753026864042368" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">@impeccable_ai is really good and is the first time I really felt a 10x productivity boost with AI. And I make an effort to try as many tools as possible.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/karatzas_thomas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Thomas Karatzas</cite><span class="t-handle">@karatzas_thomas</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/faizan10114/status/2052620908615917922" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">TIL you are the guy behind Impeccable. I owe like 3 customer conversions to you. Thank you for such an amazing tool.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/faizan10114.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Faizan Khan</cite><span class="t-handle">@faizan10114</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/MikitaHQ/status/2043352324047774008" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Shipped a landing page in 2 hours using @conductor_build &amp; @impeccable_ai. From idea to prod faster than most people pick a font ;))</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/MikitaHQ.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Mikita</cite><span class="t-handle">@MikitaHQ</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/vandotorres/status/2042263432448090256" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">THIS. This shit works.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/vandotorres.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Servando</cite><span class="t-handle">@vandotorres</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/eclecticV/status/2042086081827623331" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">This is the best plugin ever created imo.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/eclecticV.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Vishveshwar Jatain</cite><span class="t-handle">@eclecticV</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/nik_ska/status/2037158216488919184" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Claude skills are mostly BS. These ones are the rare, truly useful ones.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/nik_ska.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Nik</cite><span class="t-handle">@nik_ska</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/HeyZohaib/status/2047568264273023058" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">How is this free?? 🔥🔥</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/HeyZohaib.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Zohaib A.</cite><span class="t-handle">@HeyZohaib</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/IceCreamChai/status/2056718266593341867" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">It&#39;s crazy that @impeccable_ai is free. It replaces some paid products while being better than them.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/IceCreamChai.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Sankalp Mukim</cite><span class="t-handle">@IceCreamChai</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/michaelhedgpeth/status/2045283339264028817" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">@impeccable_ai has been a huge help at all levels from prototyping to production. It has really upped our game. I can&#39;t see anything out-of-the-box like this replacing it.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/michaelhedgpeth.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Michael Hedgpeth</cite><span class="t-handle">@michaelhedgpeth</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/littlemartta/status/2039038639087194470" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is the best frontend design skill I&#39;ve used rn. It clears the alternatives by a mile.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/littlemartta.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">martta_xu</cite><span class="t-handle">@littlemartta</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/Paul_Kinlan/status/2047580124141310457" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">This is incredible. Developer and Designer workflows are changing so quickly and for the better.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/Paul_Kinlan.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Paul Kinlan</cite><span class="t-handle">@Paul_Kinlan</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/JASHANGUPTA15/status/2057568922443133188" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Recently used this skill for my personal portfolio and was blown away. Iterated multiple times on Claude code and hardly touched Figma.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/JASHANGUPTA15.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Jashan Gupta</cite><span class="t-handle">@JASHANGUPTA15</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/sid_hori/status/2030486593048326567" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">This is 🔥. My landing page looked 100% vibe coded. I think it looks very decent now. I had fun in the process.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/sid_hori.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Sidney Hori Hawthorne</cite><span class="t-handle">@sid_hori</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/billzh/status/2035525691085603172" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">I&#39;m glad that we never need to touch Figma again. Just run 8 agents using @paper w/ Impeccable&#39;s Claude skills.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/billzh.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">billzh</cite><span class="t-handle">@billzh</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/johnennis/status/2038248854726791481" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Impeccable is such a great skill. I use it multiple times a day every day and it makes a huge difference.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/johnennis.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">John Ennis</cite><span class="t-handle">@johnennis</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/devsome_sh/status/2049193038447264007" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">Upgraded an internal tool with better UI, UX, branding and reduced AI slop. This established a standard for the project itself.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/devsome_sh.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Somesh</cite><span class="t-handle">@devsome_sh</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/alejandroreyes/status/2055495489777434973" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">It&#39;s so good.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/alejandroreyes.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Alejandro Reyes</cite><span class="t-handle">@alejandroreyes</span></span></footer></a><a class="t-card t-card--plinth" href="https://x.com/EmreCoklar/status/2036873830191251677" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="t-card-quote">This is the only set of agent skills I ever found use in. Thanks for making this.</blockquote><footer class="t-card-meta"><img class="t-avatar" src="/assets/testimonials/EmreCoklar.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="t-name-block"><cite class="t-name">Emre Coklar</cite><span class="t-handle">@EmreCoklar</span></span></footer></a></div></div></div></div></section><script type="module" src="/_astro/Testimonials.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.CFVqbUUA.js"></script><section class="slop-teaser-section slop-pattern-section" id="slop" aria-labelledby="slop-pattern-title" data-slop-scan data-detector="on"><header class="slop-pattern-head"><div><h2 id="slop-pattern-title" class="slop-teaser-title">Detects and removes AI slop.</h2><p class="slop-teaser-body"><a class="cheatsheet-link" href="/slop">62 checks &nearr;</a> catch the defaults agents keep reaching for before they become your design.</p></div><div class="slop-pattern-actions"><button class="slop-scan-control ks-switch" type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-slop-scan-button><span class="ks-switch-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ks-switch-knob"></span></span><span class="ks-switch-label" data-slop-scan-label>Detector on</span></button></div></header><div class="slop-pattern-board" aria-label="Interactive gallery of detected AI design patterns" data-impeccable-ignore="*"><a class="slop-pattern-item slop-pattern-item--serif" href="/slop#rule-italic-serif-display" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View rule: Italic serif display headline on an AI beige palette" style="--scan-order: 0"><span class="slop-pattern-specimen slop-pattern-specimen--serif" aria-hidden="true"><span class="slop-target slop-target--serif" data-label="AI beige + serif">Beautifully <em>crafted</em><br>for modern teams.</span></span></a><a class="slop-pattern-item slop-pattern-item--soft-card" href="/slop#rule-gpt-thin-border-wide-shadow" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View rule: Hairline border with wide shadow" style="--scan-order: 1"><span class="slop-pattern-specimen slop-pattern-specimen--soft-card" aria-hidden="true"><span class="slop-target slop-target--soft-card" data-label="Soft rounded card"><span class="slop-soft-card-icon">✦</span><strong>Everything in one place</strong><span class="slop-soft-card-copy">Plan, create, and collaborate with ease.</span><span class="slop-soft-card-action">Get started <i>→</i></span></span></span></a><a class="slop-pattern-item slop-pattern-item--sidetab" href="/slop#rule-side-tab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View rule: Side-tab accent border" style="--scan-order: 2"><span class="slop-pattern-specimen slop-pattern-specimen--sidetab" aria-hidden="true"><span class="slop-target slop-target--sidetab" data-label="Side-tab border"><strong>Performance insight</strong><span>Your conversion rate is up 12% this week.</span></span></span></a><a class="slop-pattern-item slop-pattern-item--eyebrow" href="/slop#rule-hero-eyebrow-chip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View rule: Hero eyebrow pill chip" style="--scan-order: 3"><span class="slop-pattern-specimen slop-pattern-specimen--eyebrow" aria-hidden="true"><span class="slop-target slop-target--eyebrow" data-label="Eyebrow chip"><span class="slop-eyebrow-chip">Introducing</span><strong>The operating system<br>for modern teams.</strong><span>Everything you need to move faster.</span></span></span></a><a class="slop-pattern-item slop-pattern-item--pulse" href="/slop#section-motion" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View rule: Decorative pulsing status dot" style="--scan-order: 4"><span class="slop-pattern-specimen slop-pattern-specimen--pulse" aria-hidden="true"><span class="slop-target slop-target--pulse" data-label="Pulsing status dot"><span class="slop-pulse-status"><i class="slop-pulse-dot"></i> AI is thinking</span><span class="slop-pulse-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></span></span></a><a class="slop-pattern-item slop-pattern-item--nested" href="/slop#rule-nested-cards" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View rule: Nested cards" style="--scan-order: 5"><span class="slop-pattern-specimen slop-pattern-specimen--nested" aria-hidden="true"><span class="slop-target slop-target--nested" data-label="Cards in cards"><span>Workspace</span><span class="slop-nested-card"><span>Overview</span><span class="slop-nested-card slop-nested-card--inner">Card inside card inside card.</span></span></span></span></a><a class="slop-pattern-item slop-pattern-item--icons" href="/slop#rule-icon-tile-stack" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View rule: Icon tile stacked above heading" style="--scan-order: 6"><span class="slop-pattern-specimen slop-pattern-specimen--icons" aria-hidden="true"><span class="slop-target slop-target--icons" data-label="Identical icon tiles"><span><i>✦</i><b>Automate</b><small>Move faster.</small></span><span><i>⌁</i><b>Integrate</b><small>Work smarter.</small></span><span><i>↗</i><b>Scale</b><small>Grow together.</small></span></span></span></a><a class="slop-pattern-item slop-pattern-item--markers" href="/slop#rule-numbered-section-labels" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View rule: Tiny numbered section labels" style="--scan-order: 7"><span class="slop-pattern-specimen slop-pattern-specimen--markers" aria-hidden="true"><span class="slop-target slop-target--markers" data-label="Numbered section labels"><span><b>01</b> Discover</span><span><b>02</b> Design</span><span><b>03</b> Deliver</span></span></span></a></div></section><script type="module" src="/_astro/SlopPatternPreview.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BY9xxFf9.js"></script><!-- 02. THE LANGUAGE - The command console, then two steering surfaces --><section class="language-section" id="language"><div id="solution" style="height:0;overflow:hidden;visibility:hidden"></div><div class="section-header" data-reveal><h2 class="section-title">Start with what you want to change.</h2><p class="section-lead">Describe what you want. Impeccable brings the design expertise.</p></div><div id="commands-section" style="height:0;overflow:hidden;visibility:hidden"></div><div class="language-content"><!-- On mobile, positioned fader caps scroll inside the deck. The shell clips
     that viewport intentionally; these are not escaping menus or tooltips. --><div class="command-console" id="command-console" data-command-console data-start="typeset" data-impeccable-ignore="clipped-overflow-container"><div class="cc-anchors" aria-hidden="true"><span id="cmd-impeccable"></span><span id="cmd-shape"></span><span id="cmd-critique"></span><span id="cmd-audit"></span><span id="cmd-typeset"></span><span id="cmd-layout"></span><span id="cmd-colorize"></span><span id="cmd-animate"></span><span id="cmd-delight"></span><span id="cmd-bolder"></span><span id="cmd-quieter"></span><span id="cmd-overdrive"></span><span id="cmd-distill"></span><span id="cmd-clarify"></span><span id="cmd-adapt"></span><span id="cmd-polish"></span><span id="cmd-optimize"></span><span id="cmd-harden"></span><span id="cmd-onboard"></span><span id="cmd-init"></span><span id="cmd-extract"></span><span id="cmd-document"></span><span id="cmd-live"></span><span id="cmd-generate"></span></div><div class="cc-guide"><p>Try it on this sample interface:</p><div class="cc-intents" aria-label="Choose a sample design task"><a href="#cmd-typeset">Make text easier to read</a><a href="#cmd-distill">Simplify a busy page</a><a href="#cmd-critique">Find what feels off</a><a href="#cmd-generate">Compare design variants</a></div></div><div class="cc-top"><!-- The window clips on purpose: it is a display, and the subject's states
         are sized to fit it. Hidden annotation states can reach its boundary;
         the visible subject is centered with breathing room by .cc-stage. --><div class="cc-well" data-cc-well aria-hidden="true" inert data-impeccable-ignore="clipped-overflow-container cramped-padding"><div class="cc-stage" data-cc-stage><!-- The subject is a deliberate "before": the purple gradient is what
             every generator ships, and the P0 to P3 tags quote the detector's
             own labels. Its card sits inside the display window because it is
             the demonstrated interface, not another layer of site navigation.
             The detector is told so, and scans the console around it. --><div class="fn" data-cc-ui data-fx="typeset" data-impeccable-ignore="ai-color-palette all-caps-body wide-tracking nested-cards"><div class="fn-head"><p class="fn-title"><span class="fn-sw" style="--o:max(var(--fx-typeset),var(--fx-bolder),var(--fx-clarify))"><span class="fn-b">Invite your team</span><span class="fn-a fn-a--typeset" style="--o:calc(var(--fx-typeset) * (1 - var(--fx-clarify)))">Invite your team</span><span class="fn-a fn-a--typeset" style="--o:calc(var(--fx-typeset) * var(--fx-clarify))">Who should have access?</span><span class="fn-a fn-a--bolder" style="--o:var(--fx-bolder)">Invite the team</span><span class="fn-a" style="--o:calc(var(--fx-clarify) * (1 - var(--fx-typeset)))">Who should have access?</span></span><span class="fn-wn" style="left:0;top:-22px">1 · task + why, one line each</span></p><span class="fn-at fn-at--l ks-tag" style="top:-12px;left:auto;right:-4px">P3 · heading level skips h2</span><p><span class="fn-sw is-wrap" style="--o:var(--fx-clarify);display:block"><span class="fn-b">Add team members to your workspace to collaborate on projects.</span><span class="fn-a">They get an email with a link. Access starts when they accept.</span></span></p></div><div class="fn-form"><span class="fn-coach">Start with the person you work with most</span><span class="fn-fld fn-fld--email"><span class="fn-sw" style="--o:var(--fx-clarify)"><span class="fn-b">Enter email address</span><span class="fn-a">Teammate's work email</span></span><span class="fn-typed" data-cc-typed><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="4a392b270a2c232f262e24253e2f642b3a3a">[email&#160;protected]</a></span></span><span class="fn-at fn-at--l ks-tag" style="left:-6px;top:-12px">P0 · no label, placeholder only</span><span class="fn-fld fn-fld--role"><span class="fn-sw is-grow" style="--o:max(var(--fx-clarify),var(--fx-harden))"><span class="fn-b">Editor</span><span class="fn-a" style="--o:var(--fx-clarify)">Can edit</span><span class="fn-a" style="--o:var(--fx-harden)">Bearbeiter:in</span></span><span class="fn-caret">▾</span></span><span class="fn-btn" data-cc-btn><span class="fn-lv"><i></i>send invite · 3 variants</span><span class="fn-sw is-grow" style="--o:max(var(--fx-clarify),var(--od-seat))"><span class="fn-b">Submit</span><span class="fn-a" style="--o:var(--fx-clarify)">Send invite</span><span class="fn-a" style="--o:var(--od-seat)">Sent</span></span><span class="fn-at ks-tag" style="top:-12px;right:-8px">P1 · contrast 3.9:1</span><span class="fn-pc" style="right:-4px;top:-16px;--pc:calc(var(--fx-polish) * (1 - var(--fx-impeccable)))">Δy 2px → 0</span><span class="fn-pc" style="right:-4px;top:-24px;--pc:var(--fx-animate)">hover · lift 1px · 150ms</span><span class="fn-pc" style="right:-4px;top:-24px;--pc:var(--fx-overdrive)">press · 160ms · scale .96</span><span class="fn-lv-strip"><span class="fn-v1">Send invite</span><span class="fn-v2">Send invite</span><span class="fn-v3">Send invite</span></span></span><span class="fn-err">We couldn't send that invite. Check the address and try again.</span><span class="fn-wn" style="left:0;bottom:-20px">2 · email + role, one action</span><span class="fn-fly" data-cc-fly><span class="fn-av"><span>SO</span></span><span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="6f1c0e022f09060a030b01001b0a410e1f1f">[email&#160;protected]</a></span></span></div><ul class="fn-list"><span class="fn-at fn-at--l ks-tag" style="left:-6px;top:6px">P2 · initials 2.6:1 on gradient</span><span class="fn-pc" style="left:-10px;top:-9px;--pc:var(--fx-animate)">rows · 380ms · 70ms apart · ease-out</span><span class="fn-pc" style="right:-4px;top:-9px;--pc:var(--fx-overdrive)">spring · ζ 0.5 · 8px overshoot</span><span class="fn-pc" style="left:-10px;top:44px;--pc:calc(var(--fx-polish) * (1 - var(--fx-impeccable)))">rule 2px → 1px</span><li class="fn-fresh-wrap" data-cc-fresh-wrap><div class="fn-fresh-in"><div class="fn-li fn-li--fresh" data-cc-fresh><span class="fn-av"><span>SO</span></span><span class="fn-nm"><b>Sam Ortega</b><span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="285b4945684e414d444c46475c4d06495858">[email&#160;protected]</a></span></span><span class="fn-rl">Viewer</span><span class="fn-st"><i class="is-pending"></i><span>Invited</span></span></div></div></li><li class="fn-li" style="--skel:block"><span class="fn-av"><span>MO</span></span><span class="fn-nm"><b><span class="fn-sw" style="--o:var(--fx-harden)"><span class="fn-b">Mara Okafor</span><span class="fn-a">Mara Okafor-Adebayo Oluwaseun</span></span></b><span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="bfd2decddeffd9d6dad3dbd1d0cbda91decfcf">[email&#160;protected]</a></span></span><span class="fn-rl">Admin</span><span class="fn-st"><i></i><span>Active</span></span></li><li class="fn-li fn-li--flaw" style="--skel:block"><span class="fn-av"><span>JL</span></span><span class="fn-nm"><b>Jonas Lindqvist</b><span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f3999c9d9280b3959a969f979d9c8796dd928383">[email&#160;protected]</a></span></span><span class="fn-rl">Editor</span><span class="fn-st"><i></i><span>Active</span></span></li><li class="fn-li" style="--skel:block"><span class="fn-av"><span>PN</span></span><span class="fn-nm"><b>Priya Nair</b><span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f08082998991b09699959c949e9f8495de918080">[email&#160;protected]</a></span></span><span class="fn-rl">Viewer</span><span class="fn-st"><i class="is-pending"></i><span>Pending</span></span></li><li class="fn-li fn-li--ghost"><span class="fn-av"><span>+</span></span><span class="fn-nm"><b>Two seats left. Who do you always end up cc'ing on this?</b></span><span class="fn-rl" style="opacity:0"></span><span></span></li></ul><div class="fn-empty"><div class="fn-steps"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><b>No teammates yet</b>Invite one and they show up here. Step 1 of 3.</div><div class="fn-foot"><span><span class="fn-sw" style="--o:max(var(--fx-clarify),var(--od-seat))"><span class="fn-b">3/5 seats</span><span class="fn-a" style="--o:calc(var(--fx-clarify) * (1 - var(--od-seat)))">2 more people can join on this plan</span><span class="fn-a" style="--o:var(--od-seat)">4/5 seats</span></span></span><span class="fn-lnk"><span class="fn-sw" style="--o:max(var(--fx-clarify),var(--fx-bolder))"><span class="fn-b">Upgrade</span><span class="fn-a" style="--o:var(--fx-clarify)">Add seats</span><span class="fn-a fn-a--bolder" style="--o:var(--fx-bolder)">Add seats</span></span><span class="fn-at ks-tag" style="right:0;top:-18px">P3 · target 20px</span></span><span class="fn-wn" style="left:0;bottom:-18px">3 · who has access, plan limit</span></div></div><!-- overlays beside the subject --><div class="cc-ov cc-ov--notes" data-cc-ov="critique"><div class="cc-note"><i>1</i>Title and button fight for the eye. Only one should win.</div><div class="cc-note"><i>2</i>Extra details distract from inviting your team.</div><div class="cc-note"><i>3</i>Pending looks the same as Active. The row that needs a nudge never asks for one.</div><div class="cc-score">Hierarchy 4<br>Clarity 6<br>Craft 5<b>5.2</b></div></div><div class="cc-ov cc-ov--notes" data-cc-ov="audit"><div class="cc-score is-bare">1 P0 · 1 P1<br>1 P2 · 2 P3<b>61</b>of 100</div><div class="cc-note is-after"><i class="is-gold">!</i>Fix the P0 first: a visible label on the email field.</div></div><div class="cc-ov cc-ov--notes cc-ov--left" data-cc-ov="shape"><div class="cc-score is-bare">brief<b class="is-small">Fieldnote</b></div><div class="cc-note is-after"><i>→</i>Teams of 2 to 10. Invite in under 30 seconds. Owner sees seats before paying.</div></div><div class="cc-ov cc-ov--sheet" data-cc-ov="init"><div class="cc-ov-file"><span>PRODUCT.md</span><span>written</span></div><b class="cc-ov-h">## Register</b><p>product</p><b class="cc-ov-h">## Platform</b><p>web</p><b class="cc-ov-h">## Users</b><p>Small teams keeping field notes together. Most invites happen in the first hour.</p><b class="cc-ov-h">## Principles</b><p>Calm by default. One action per screen. Never hide the seat count.</p></div><div class="cc-ov cc-ov--sheet" data-cc-ov="document"><div class="cc-ov-file"><span>DESIGN.md</span><span>from what ships</span></div><b class="cc-ov-h">## Color</b><div class="cc-swatches" data-impeccable-ignore="ai-color-palette"><i style="background:oklch(99.5% 0 0)"></i><i style="background:var(--ks-gray)"></i><i style="background:var(--cc-gray-3)"></i><i style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,oklch(58% 0.2 300),oklch(62% 0.22 330))"></i><i style="background:oklch(70% 0.17 150)"></i></div><p>paper, gray-1, gray-3, accent (gradient, flagged), success</p><b class="cc-ov-h">## Type</b><p>Albert Sans · 18/600 title · 13/400 body · 12/400 meta</p><b class="cc-ov-h">## Shape</b><p>radius 8 fields · 3 pills · 12 card (inconsistent)</p></div><div class="cc-ov cc-ov--side" data-cc-ov="extract"><div class="cc-ov-file">Extracted</div><div class="cc-ov-t"><b>&lt;Avatar&gt;</b><span>×3</span></div><div class="cc-ov-t"><b>&lt;Field&gt;</b><span>×2</span></div><div class="cc-ov-t"><b>&lt;RolePill&gt;</b><span>×3</span></div><div class="cc-ov-t"><b>--radius-2</b><span>8px</span></div><div class="cc-ov-t"><b>--border</b><span>gray-3</span></div><div class="cc-ov-t"><b>--accent</b><span>1 use</span></div></div><div class="cc-ov cc-ov--perf" data-cc-ov="optimize"><span>LCP</span><span class="cc-bar"><i style="--w0:100;--w1:32"></i></span><b>3.4s → 1.1s</b><span>JS</span><span class="cc-bar"><i style="--w0:82;--w1:17"></i></span><b>412 kB → 86 kB</b><span>Avatars</span><span class="cc-bar"><i style="--w0:60;--w1:9"></i></span><b>3 × 380 kB → webp</b></div><div class="cc-ov cc-ov--hardtag" data-cc-ov="harden"><span class="ks-tag is-quiet">de-DE · 1.6× text</span><span class="ks-tag is-quiet">name · 31 chars</span><span class="ks-tag is-quiet">network · failed</span></div></div></div><div class="cc-readout"><div class="cc-title"><h3 class="cc-name" data-cc-r-name>typeset</h3><div class="site-code-block code-block-wrap site-code-block--mono is-command cc-cmd" data-code-variant="mono" data-site-code="skip" data-command-syntax="fixed">
  
