</div><script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script type="module" src="/_astro/CodeBlock.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.22CWwjaT.js"></script><div class="cc-tags"><span class="ks-tag" data-cc-r-group>refine</span><span class="ks-tag is-quiet" data-cc-r-kind-tag>fader</span></div></div><p class="cc-desc" data-cc-r-desc>Make text easier to read, with clearer headings, better sizing, and comfortable line lengths.</p><ol class="cc-mobile-findings" aria-label="Example critique findings"><li>Title and button compete for attention.</li><li>Extra details distract from inviting your team.</li><li>Pending invitations look like active teammates.</li></ol><a class="cc-docs" href="/docs/typeset" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cc-r-docs>How to use this command &rarr;</a><div class="cc-patch"><span class="cc-silk">Try next</span><span class="cc-jacks" data-cc-r-patch><button class="cc-jack" type="button" data-to="layout"><i></i><span>layout</span></button><button class="cc-jack" type="button" data-to="polish"><i></i><span>polish</span></button></span></div></div></div><p class="cc-deck-help"><span class="cc-deck-help-wide">Choose a command below. Drag a slider to compare.</span><span class="cc-deck-help-scroll">Scroll sideways to browse commands. Drag a slider to compare.</span></p><div class="cc-deck" data-cc-deck><div class="cc-g"><span class="ks-tag is-quiet cc-g-l">create</span><div class="cc-g-b cc-g-b--keys cc-g-b--col"><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="impeccable"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">impeccable</span></button><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="shape"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">shape</span></button></div></div><div class="cc-g"><span class="ks-tag is-quiet cc-g-l">evaluate</span><div class="cc-g-b cc-g-b--keys cc-g-b--col"><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="critique"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">critique</span></button><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="audit"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">audit</span></button></div></div><div class="cc-g"><span class="ks-tag is-quiet cc-g-l">refine</span><div class="cc-g-b"><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="typeset" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="typeset"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">typeset</b></div><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="layout" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="layout"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">layout</b></div><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="colorize" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="colorize"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">colorize</b></div><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="animate" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="animate"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">animate</b></div><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="delight" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="delight"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">delight</b></div><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="bolder" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="bolder"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">bolder</b></div><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="quieter" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="quieter"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">quieter</b></div><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="overdrive" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="overdrive"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">overdrive</b></div></div></div><div class="cc-g"><span class="ks-tag is-quiet cc-g-l">simplify</span><div class="cc-g-b"><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="distill" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="distill"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">distill</b></div><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="clarify" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="clarify"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">clarify</b></div><div class="cc-ch" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="adapt" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-cmd="adapt"><i class="cc-led"></i><div class="cc-trk"><span class="cc-cap"></span></div><b class="cc-lbl">adapt</b></div></div></div><div class="cc-g"><span class="ks-tag is-quiet cc-g-l">harden</span><div class="cc-g-b cc-g-b--keys"><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="polish"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">polish</span></button><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="optimize"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">optimize</span></button><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="harden"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">harden</span></button><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="onboard"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">onboard</span></button></div></div><div class="cc-g"><span class="ks-tag is-quiet cc-g-l">system</span><div class="cc-g-b cc-g-b--keys"><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="init"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">init</span></button><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="extract"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">extract</span></button><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="document"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">document</span></button><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="live"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">live</span></button><button type="button" class="cc-key" aria-pressed="false" data-cmd="generate"><i class="cc-led"></i><span class="cc-lbl">generate</span></button></div></div></div></div><script type="module" src="/_astro/CommandConsole.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.DSfn-oiT.js"></script><section class="language-steering" aria-labelledby="language-steering-title"><header class="language-steering-head"><h3 id="language-steering-title">Impeccable in action</h3></header><div class="steering-desktop" data-steering-desktop data-mobile-pane="agent" data-impeccable-ignore="gpt-thin-border-wide-shadow"><div class="steering-desktop-bar"><span class="steering-window-controls" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="steering-desktop-context">main</span><span class="steering-desktop-brand"><i aria-hidden="true"></i> Claudex Cocursor</span></div><div class="steering-mobile-tabs ks-instrument-strip is-paper" role="tablist" aria-label="Steering demo view" data-impeccable-ignore="nested-cards"><button type="button" role="tab" class="ks-instrument-key is-active" data-steering-mobile-tab="agent" aria-selected="true">Agent thread</button><button type="button" role="tab" class="ks-instrument-key" data-steering-mobile-tab="browser" aria-selected="false">In-app browser</button></div><div class="steering-desktop-panes"><article class="steering-pane steering-agent" tabindex="0" data-steering-pane="agent"><header class="steering-pane-head"><span class="steering-pane-meta">Working tree</span></header><div class="steering-thread" data-steering-thread aria-label="Example Impeccable agent thread"><div class="steering-thread-scene" data-steering-thread-scene="polish"><div class="steering-thread-user"><span>You</span><p><code class="steering-command"><span class="steering-command-name">/impeccable</span> <span class="steering-command-verb" data-steering-active-command>polish</span></code> the pricing page. Keep our sharp corners and sober palette. Remove the AI tells.</p></div><div class="steering-thread-agent" aria-live="polite"><span>Agent</span><p data-steering-agent-copy>I’ll polish the page within its existing design system, then run the detector before I hand it back.</p><div class="steering-hook-log"><p><i aria-hidden="true">↳</i><strong>DESIGN.md loaded</strong><small>Existing system preserved</small></p><p><i class="steering-impeccable-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M5 2.5 L13.5 2.5 L5.5 21.5 L5 21.5 Q2.5 21.5 2.5 19 L2.5 5 Q2.5 2.5 5 2.5 Z"></path><path d="M16.5 2.5 L19 2.5 Q21.5 2.5 21.5 5 L21.5 19 Q21.5 21.5 19 21.5 L8.5 21.5 Z"></path></svg></i><strong>4 tells found</strong><small>AI beige · italic serif · side-tab · pulsing dot</small></p><p><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i><strong>Written to source</strong><small>0 detector findings</small></p></div></div></div><div class="steering-thread-scene steering-thread-scene--live" data-steering-thread-scene="live"><div class="steering-thread-user"><span>You</span><p><code class="steering-command"><span class="steering-command-name">/impeccable</span> <span class="steering-command-verb">live</span></code></p></div><div class="steering-thread-agent"><span>Agent</span><p>Starting Live Mode against the running app. I’ll open the page, then wait for element picks and page-level steering.</p><div class="steering-hook-log"><p><i class="steering-impeccable-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 2