/button><button type="button" class="live-demo-gbar-btn" aria-label="Detect anti-patterns" aria-hidden="true" inert data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></circle></svg><span class="live-demo-gbar-btn-label" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq>Detect</span></button><button type="button" class="live-demo-gbar-btn" aria-label="Toggle DESIGN.md panel" aria-hidden="true" inert data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><span class="live-demo-gbar-dmd" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><span data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></span><span data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></span><span data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></span><span data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></span></span><span class="live-demo-gbar-btn-label live-demo-gbar-btn-label--mono" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq>DESIGN.md</span></button><div class="live-demo-gbar-chat" data-demo-gbar-chat data-expanded="false" title="Steer the page" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><span class="live-demo-gbar-chat-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></path></svg></span><button type="button" class="live-demo-gbar-chat-hint" aria-label="Try steering the page" aria-expanded="false" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq>Steer</button><input class="live-demo-gbar-chat-input" type="text" placeholder="Steer the page…" aria-label="Steer the page" tabindex="-1" hidden data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><button type="button" class="live-demo-gbar-chat-voice" aria-label="Voice input" title="Voice input requires browser speech recognition." disabled data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></path><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></path><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="12" y2="23" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></line><line x1="8" y1="23" x2="16" y2="23" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></line></svg></button></div><button type="button" class="live-demo-gbar-x" aria-label="Exit live mode" aria-hidden="true" inert data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq><line x1="3" y1="3" x2="11" y2="11" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></line><line x1="11" y1="3" x2="3" y2="11" data-astro-cid-j6ck2wjq></line></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></section></div></section><!-- 03. WORLDS: the live roll. Deals six flagship worlds from /api/roll,
         Neo Mirai anchors as the played card. Replaces the old Neo Mirai
         bento tile; the page only ever renders what a roll deals. --><section class="worlds-section" id="worlds" aria-labelledby="worlds-title" data-worlds-section data-cards-base="/worlds/cards"><div class="section-header" data-reveal><h2 class="section-title" id="worlds-title">Give your design a different starting point.</h2></div><div class="worlds-intro" data-reveal><p class="section-lead worlds-lead">Explore human-reviewed design directions, each with its own visual rules. Impeccable weighs these against ideas drawn from your product, then builds around the strongest fit.</p></div><div class="worlds-table"><div class="worlds-hand-zone"><div class="worlds-zone-head"><span class="ks-tag" data-impeccable-ignore="undersized-ui-text">01 &middot; Explore directions</span><div class="worlds-deck-controls"><span class="worlds-roll-meta" data-worlds-meta aria-hidden="true"></span><button type="button" class="worlds-reroll" data-worlds-reroll disabled><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="worlds-reroll-die"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></rect><circle cx="8.4" cy="8.4" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="15.6" cy="8.4" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="8.4" cy="15.6" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="15.6" cy="15.6" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><span>Show more</span></button></div></div><ul class="worlds-hand" data-worlds-hand aria-label="Design directions"></ul><p class="worlds-hand-status" data-worlds-status role="status"></p></div><aside class="worlds-played-zone" aria-label="A finished example"><div class="worlds-zone-head"><span class="ks-tag" data-impeccable-ignore="undersized-ui-text">02 &middot; See one built</span></div><a class="worlds-played-card" href="/neo-mirai/index.html" data-impeccable-ignore="gpt-thin-border-wide-shadow undersized-ui-text"><span class="worlds-played-chip ks-tag">Built with Impeccable</span><img src="assets/cases/neo-mirai/live-fold.webp" alt="Neo Mirai conference website" width="1440" height="1100" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="worlds-played-caption"><strong>Neo Mirai</strong><span>One design direction, carried through a complete website.</span><span class="worlds-played-cta ks-tag">Explore the result &rarr;</span></span></a><p class="worlds-played-meta"><a href="/neo-mirai/index.html">Open the live build &rarr;</a><a href="/cases/neo-mirai">Read the case &rarr;</a></p></aside></div><p class="worlds-research"><a class="cheatsheet-link" href="/research">Why explore this way? Read the research &rarr;</a></p></section><script type="module" src="/_astro/WorldsRoll.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.CBcqumjn.js"></script><!-- 05. READY TO DROP IN: bento grid with five tiles. Replaces the
         carousel (initWhyTabs in app.js returns early when .why-layout is
         missing, so leaving that JS in place is harmless). Tiles share
         inner content classes (.why-panel-title, .why-panel-body,
         .why-visual--*) with the old carousel; only the outer chrome
         changed. --><section class="why-section" id="why"><div class="why-content" data-reveal><div class="section-header"><h2 class="section-title">Built around your project.</h2></div><div class="ks-bento why-bento"><!-- T1: hero, wide. Respects your design system. --><article class="ks-bento-tile ks-bento-tile--span-6" id="why-respects"><h3 class="why-panel-title">Respects your design system.</h3><p class="why-panel-body">Build and refine with your existing colors, components, and rules. New pages feel like part of the same product.</p><div class="why-visual why-visual--terminal"><div class="why-terminal"><div class="why-terminal-header"><span class="why-terminal-dot"></span><span class="why-terminal-dot"></span><span class="why-terminal-dot"></span><span class="why-terminal-title">/impeccable polish : scanning codebase</span></div><div class="why-terminal-body"><div class="why-terminal-line why-terminal-line--prompt"><span class="why-terminal-prompt">&rsaquo;</span> Walking src/…</div><div class="why-terminal-line">  <span class="why-terminal-ok">&check;</span> <span class="why-terminal-path">src/styles/tokens.css</span> &nbsp;<span class="why-terminal-meta">14 colors, 6 font sizes, 7 spacing steps</span></div><div class="why-terminal-line">  <span class="why-terminal-ok">&check;</span> <span class="why-terminal-path">tailwind.config.ts</span> &nbsp;<span class="why-terminal-meta">theme.extend merged</span></div><div class="why-terminal-line">  <span class="why-terminal-ok">&check;</span> <span class="why-terminal-path">src/components/</span> &nbsp;<span class="why-terminal-meta">34 components</span></div><div class="why-terminal-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="why-terminal-meta">&middot; Button: primary, secondary, ghost, destructive</span></div><div class="why-terminal-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="why-terminal-meta">&middot; Card: 3 variants, 8px / 16px radii</span></div><div class="why-terminal-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="why-terminal-meta">&middot; Input, Select, Dialog, Toast, Table&hellip;</span></div><div class="why-terminal-line">  <span class="why-terminal-ok">&check;</span> <span class="why-terminal-path">DESIGN.md</span> &nbsp;<span class="why-terminal-meta">brand rules loaded</span></div><div class="why-terminal-line why-terminal-line--hint"><span class="why-terminal-arrow">&rarr;</span> Using your existing design rules.</div></div></div></div></article><!-- T2: narrow. Real product context: PRODUCT.md as an editor sees
               it, and the commands that read it taking turns on the strip. --><article class="ks-bento-tile ks-bento-tile--span-6" id="why-product"><h3 class="why-panel-title">Tell it what matters to your users.</h3><p class="why-panel-body">Explain your users and their goals once. Impeccable saves that context in <code>PRODUCT.md</code> and reads it before design work.</p><div class="why-visual why-visual--productmd"><div class="why-pm-file" role="img" aria-label="Example PRODUCT.md with users, product purpose, and accessibility requirements."><div class="why-pm-header"><span class="why-pm-filename">PRODUCT.md</span><span class="why-pm-lang">Markdown</span></div><ol class="why-pm-lines" aria-hidden="true"><li class="why-pm-key">## Users</li><li>People responding to service outages, often on a phone.</li><li class="why-pm-blank"></li><li class="why-pm-key">## Product Purpose</li><li>Help teams find what caused an outage.</li><li class="why-pm-blank"></li><li class="why-pm-key">## Accessibility &amp; Inclusion</li><li>Keep alerts readable on small screens.</li></ol></div><div class="why-pm-reads" aria-hidden="true"><span class="why-pm-reads-label">Read by</span><div class="ks-instrument-strip is-paper why-pm-strip" data-why-reads><span class="ks-instrument-key is-active">polish</span><span class="ks-instrument-key">audit</span><span class="ks-instrument-key">layout</span></div></div></div></article><!-- T3: narrow. DESIGN.md travels. Restored from the parked panel
               at site/_parked/the-case.astro. --><article class="ks-bento-tile ks-bento-tile--span-4" id="why-designmd"><h3 class="why-panel-title">Keep your design decisions.</h3><p class="why-panel-body"><code>/impeccable document</code> records your visual system in <code>DESIGN.md</code>, ready for the next feature or the next agent.</p><div class="why-visual why-visual--designmd-v2"><div class="why-dm-header"><span class="why-dm-filename">Example DESIGN.md</span><span class="why-dm-badge">Google Stitch spec</span></div><div class="why-dm-grid"><div class="why-dm-tile why-dm-tile--color" style="--c: var(--ks-kinpaku);"><div class="why-dm-tile-meta"><span>Primary</span><span>oklch(78% .12 82)</span></div><div class="why-dm-color-hero"></div><div class="why-dm-color-ramp"><span style="background: oklch(22% .04 78)"></span><span style="background: oklch(34% .06 78)"></span><span style="background: oklch(48% .08 78)"></span><span style="background: oklch(61% .085 78)"></span><span style="background: oklch(72% .105 82)"></span><span style="background: oklch(78% .12 82)"></span><span style="background: oklch(84% .075 84)"></span><span style="background: oklch(89% .055 84)"></span></div></div><div class="why-dm-tile why-dm-tile--type"><div class="why-dm-tile-meta"><span>Body</span><span>Regular 400</span></div><div class="why-dm-type-specimen why-dm-type-specimen--sans">Aa</div><div class="why-dm-type-family">Avenir Next</div></div><div class="why-dm-tile why-dm-tile--components"><div class="why-dm-tile-meta"><span>Components</span><span>34</span></div><div class="why-dm-comp-row"><span class="why-dm-comp-chip why-dm-comp-chip--primary">Primary</span><span class="why-dm-comp-chip">Ghost</span></div><div class="why-dm-comp-input">Email address</div></div></div><div class="why-dm-foot"><a href="/docs/document">About DESIGN.md &rarr;</a></div></div></article><!-- T4: medium. Surface modes as four miniatures; the mode the
               PRODUCT.md demo names (Operate) is the lit one. --><article class="ks-bento-tile ks-bento-tile--span-4" id="why-modes"><h3 class="why-panel-title">Design for the job at hand.</h3><p class="why-panel-body">Help people decide on a landing page, or get things done in a dashboard. Impeccable designs for the task.</p><div class="why-visual why-visual--modes"><ul class="why-modes" aria-label="The four surface modes"><li class="why-mode"><span class="why-mode-thumb why-mode-thumb--persuade" aria-hidden="true"><i class="why-mode-mark"></i><span class="why-mode-nav"><i></i><i></i></span><i class="why-mode-h1"></i><i class="why-mode-h1 why-mode-h1--short"></i><i class="why-mode-copy"></i><i class="why-mode-copy why-mode-copy--short"></i><i class="why-mode-cta"></i><i class="why-mode-art"></i></span><span class="why-mode-label">Persuade</span></li><li class="why-mode is-lit"><span class="why-mode-thumb why-mode-thumb--operate" aria-hidden="true"><span class="why-mode-side"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><i class="why-mode-bar"></i><span class="why-mode-stats"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="why-mode-panel"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class="why-mode-label">Operate</span></li><li class="why-mode"><span class="why-mode-thumb why-mode-thumb--read" aria-hidden="true"><i class="why-mode-eyebrow"></i><i class="why-mode-title"></i><i class="why-mode-title why-mode-title--short"></i><span class="why-mode-paragraph"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="why-mode-paragraph why-mode-paragraph--short"><i></i><i></i></span><i class="why-mode-rule"></i></span><span class="why-mode-label">Read</span></li><li class="why-mode"><span class="why-mode-thumb why-mode-thumb--experience" aria-hidden="true"><i class="why-mode-mark"></i><span class="why-mode-nav"><i></i><i></i></span><i class="why-mode-caption"></i><i class="why-mode-copy"></i><i class="why-mode-control"></i></span><span class="why-mode-label">Experience</span></li></ul></div></article><!-- T5: medium. One pass of the design hook, drawn as a timeline:
               the edit, the findings it returns, the fix, the ready PR. --><article class="ks-bento-tile ks-bento-tile--span-4" id="why-ci"><h3 class="why-panel-title">Catch slop as your agent works.</h3><p class="why-panel-body">The design hook checks UI edits and sends findings back to your agent. It runs in code, without an AI model or API key.</p><div class="why-visual why-visual--hook"><ol class="why-hook" aria-label="Example: a design hook reports issues and the agent fixes them"><li class="why-hook-step"><span class="why-hook-label">Agent edits the page</span><span class="why-hook-row"><code class="why-hook-file">Hero.tsx</code></span></li><li class="why-hook-step"><span class="why-hook-label">Detector reports issues</span><span class="why-hook-row"><span class="ks-tag" data-impeccable-ignore="undersized-ui-text">AI beige</span><span class="ks-tag" data-impeccable-ignore="undersized-ui-text">Clipped label</span></span></li><li class="why-hook-step"><span class="why-hook-label">Agent fixes them</span><span class="why-hook-row"><code class="why-hook-file">Hero.tsx</code><span class="ks-tag is-quiet" data-impeccable-ignore="undersized-ui-text">Second pass</span></span></li><li class="why-hook-step is-ready"><span class="why-hook-label">No issues detected</span><span class="why-hook-row why-hook-state">0 findings</span></li></ol></div><p class="why-panel-meta"><a href="/docs/hooks#allow-the-hook-in-your-harness">Set up hooks for your web project &rarr;</a></p></article></div></div></section><!-- 06. GET STARTED --><section class="downloads" id="downloads" aria-labelledby="downloads-title"><div class="downloads-top"><div class="downloads-head"><h2 id="downloads-title" class="downloads-title">Install Impeccable</h2><p class="downloads-lead">Install the skill, switch on automatic design checks, and make something you’re proud of.</p></div><div class="downloads-install" data-install-tabs data-install-flow><details class="downloads-flow-step" data-install-step="1" open><summary class="downloads-flow-heading"><span class="downloads-flow-number">1</span><span>Install Impeccable</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></summary><div class="downloads-flow-body"><div class="downloads-step"><div class="downloads-tabs"><span class="downloads-tabs-label" id="install-tabs-label">Install via</span><div class="downloads-method-strip" role="tablist" aria-labelledby="install-tabs-label"><button class="downloads-tab is-active" type="button" role="tab" id="install-tab-impeccable" aria-controls="install-panel-impeccable update-panel-impeccable" aria-selected="true" data-method="impeccable">CLI</button><button class="downloads-tab" type="button" role="tab" id="install-tab-codex" aria-controls="install-panel-codex update-panel-codex" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-method="codex">Codex</button><button class="downloads-tab" type="button" role="tab" id="install-tab-marketplace" aria-controls="install-panel-marketplace update-panel-marketplace" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-method="marketplace">Claude plugin</button><button class="downloads-tab" type="button" role="tab" id="install-tab-skills" aria-controls="install-panel-skills update-panel-skills" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-method="skills">skills.sh</button></div></div><div class="downloads-method-panel" id="install-panel-impeccable" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="install-tab-impeccable" data-method-panel="impeccable"><p class="downloads-method-note">Run in your project folder, then follow the prompts.</p><div class="site-code-block code-block-wrap site-code-block--mono is-command" data-code-variant="mono" data-site-code="skip" data-command-syntax="fixed">
  
  <span class="site-code-prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
  <pre class="site-code-content" tabindex="0"><code>npx <span class="site-code-invocation">impeccable</span> install</code></pre>
  <button data-install-copy="" class="site-code-copy downloads-copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy install command" data-copy="npx impeccable install" data-copy-feedback="">
      <svg class="site-code-copy-icon downloads-copy-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"></rect>
        <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 01-2-2V4a2 2 0 012-2h9a2 2 0 012 2v1"></path>
      </svg>
      <svg class="site-code-check-icon downloads-check-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path>
      </svg>
      <span class="site-code-copy-label" aria-hidden="true">Copy</span>
    </button>
