ce" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="install-tab-marketplace" data-method-panel="marketplace" hidden><p class="downloads-update-line downloads-update-menu">Update through the <code>/plugin</code> menu in Claude Code.</p></div><div class="downloads-method-panel" id="update-panel-skills" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="install-tab-skills" data-method-panel="skills" hidden><p class="downloads-update-line">Update Impeccable with <code>npx skills update impeccable</code><button class="downloads-copy downloads-copy--inline" type="button" aria-label="Copy update command" data-copy="npx skills update impeccable"><svg class="downloads-copy-icon" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 01-2-2V4a2 2 0 012-2h9a2 2 0 012 2v1"></path></svg><svg class="downloads-check-icon" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Copy</span></button></p></div></div></div></details><button class="downloads-next" type="button" data-install-next="2">Next: set up your project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div></details><details class="downloads-flow-step" data-install-step="2"><summary class="downloads-flow-heading"><span class="downloads-flow-number">2</span><span>Initialize &amp; enable hooks</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></summary><div class="downloads-flow-body"><p class="downloads-flow-notice" data-install-reminder hidden></p><p class="downloads-flow-intro">Give your agent context about your product and design direction, then enable hooks to catch design issues as it works.</p><div class="downloads-hook-approval"><h3>Your coding tool must also allow hooks</h3><p>After running the commands below, complete your tool’s hook approval or workspace trust steps so checks can run.</p><p><strong>Using Codex?</strong> Open <strong>Settings → Hooks</strong> in the app, or <code>/hooks</code> in the CLI. Review and trust Impeccable’s <code>PostToolUse</code> and <code>Stop</code> hooks. They won’t run until you do.</p><a href="/docs/hooks#allow-the-hook-in-your-harness">Check the approval steps for your tool <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="downloads-syntax" role="group" aria-label="Command syntax"><span>Using</span><button type="button" data-setup-syntax="slash" aria-pressed="true">Other tools</button><button type="button" data-setup-syntax="codex" aria-pressed="false">Codex</button></div><div class="downloads-step"><h3 class="downloads-cmd-label">Initialize your project</h3><p class="downloads-method-note" data-setup-instruction>Reload your coding tool. In the agent chat, run:</p><div class="site-code-block code-block-wrap site-code-block--mono is-command" data-code-variant="mono" data-site-code="skip" data-command-syntax="fixed">
  
  <span class="site-code-prompt" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
  <pre class="site-code-content" tabindex="0"><code data-setup-command="">/impeccable init</code></pre>
