</div></div><div class="downloads-step"><h3 class="downloads-cmd-label">Turn on automatic checks</h3><div class="site-code-block code-block-wrap site-code-block--mono is-command" data-code-variant="mono" data-site-code="skip" data-command-syntax="fixed">
  
