</div><p class="downloads-method-note">Already enabled? Your agent will confirm the current setup.</p></div><button class="downloads-next" type="button" data-install-next="3">Next: stay in the loop <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div></details><details class="downloads-flow-step" data-install-step="3"><summary class="downloads-flow-heading"><span class="downloads-flow-number">3</span><span>Stay in the loop</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></summary><div class="downloads-flow-body"><p class="downloads-flow-intro">Impeccable keeps evolving. Get the latest announcements, updates, and tips for better design with your agent.</p><ul class="downloads-follow"><li><div><strong>Design better with every update.</strong><p>Design lessons, walkthroughs, and tips and tricks in your inbox.</p></div><a class="ks-button ks-button-primary" href="https://impeccablestyle.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe on Substack <span class="ks-button-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"><path d="M0 4h14M10 0l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></span></a></li><li><div><strong>Catch what’s new.</strong><p>New releases, quick tips, and work worth sharing.</p></div><a class="ks-button ks-button-secondary" href="https://x.com/impeccable_ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow on X <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"></path></svg></a></li><li><div><strong>Help Impeccable grow.</strong><p>Star the repo to support the project and keep it close.</p></div><a class="ks-button ks-button-secondary" href="https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Star on GitHub <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"></path></svg></a></li></ul><a class="downloads-next" href="/tutorials/getting-started">Start designing <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></details></div><script type="module" src="/_astro/InstallFlow.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.lTheZHVM.js"></script></div><ul class="downloads-extras"><li><strong>Chrome extension</strong><span>Find design issues on a page in Chrome. Open the Impeccable panel in DevTools to see what needs attention.</span><a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/impeccable/bdkgmiklpdmaojlpflclinlofgjfpabf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get the Chrome extension →</a></li><li><strong>Automated checks</strong><span>Check UI changes in your pull requests. The CLI returns findings and exit codes your build can act on.</span><a href="/docs/detector">Set up automated checks →</a></li></ul><p class="downloads-more"><a href="/tutorials/getting-started">Getting started</a> &middot; <a href="/designing">Designing with Impeccable</a> &middot; <a href="/docs">Command reference</a> &middot; <a href="/changelog">Changelog</a> &middot; <a href="/faq">FAQ</a></p></section></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-row"><a class="footer-logo" href="/">Impeccable</a><nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer"><a href="/gallery">Gallery</a><a href="/changelog">Changelog</a><a href="/faq">FAQ</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="https://app.vanta.com/renaissance-geek.ai/trust/jhldu1ow0u17opmmk3s7zk">Trust Center</a><a href="https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable">GitHub</a></nav><div class="footer-credit"><span>Created by <a href="https://x.com/pbakaus" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Paul Bakaus</a></span><a href="https://x.com/pbakaus" class="footer-social-link" aria-label="Follow on X" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"></path></svg></a><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/paulbakaus" class="footer-social-link" aria-label="Connect on LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"></path></svg></a></div></div></footer><script type="module" src="/_astro/index.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.D1UILVIw.js"></script><script>
      // Tile 02: the command keys take turns reading PRODUCT.md. Only the
      // is-active class moves; instrument-strip.js slides the cap to match.
      (function () {
        const strip = document.querySelector('[data-why-reads]');
        if (!strip || window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) return;
        const keys = Array.from(strip.querySelectorAll('.ks-instrument-key'));
        let i = 0;
        let timer = 0;
        const step = () => {
          i = (i + 1) % keys.length;
          keys.forEach((key, n) => key.classList.toggle('is-active', n === i));
        };
        const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          const on = entries.some((e) => e.isIntersecting);
          if (on && !timer) timer = window.setInterval(step, 1600);
          if (!on && timer) { window.clearInterval(timer); timer = 0; }
        }, { threshold: 0.4 });
        io.observe(strip);
      })();
    </script><script type="module" src="/_astro/index.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.CgmVvbhy.js"></script><script type="module" src="/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BD-jcN2D.js"></script><!-- Cloudflare Pages Analytics --><script defer src='https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js' data-cf-beacon='{"token": "2375b0fdc85c43a68f4b0e89cc6ae43c"}'></script><!-- Cloudflare Pages Analytics --></body></html>